# GitHub only

This repository’s source of truth is **GitHub**: https://github.com/carlojolly/my-design-code

- Keep `origin` pointed at that GitHub URL (never `origin.cursor.com`).
- Push feature branches with `git push -u origin <branch>`.
- Create and update pull requests with the GitHub CLI (`gh pr …`) against `main`.
- Do **not** open, update, or merge Cursor Origin PRs for this project.
- If platform tooling defaults to Origin, override it and use GitHub instead.

Full policy: repo-root `AGENTS.md`.
